          "value": "Here’s the thing about Johannes Voss: he is really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really, really talented. And he’s a double threat, too—these cards come together to tell a story and feature a poem written by the man himself. Honestly, it’s kind of messed up that he’s hogging all this talent for himself, but we’ll let it slide because he’s so dang nice. These gorgeous cards will add a pop of color to any deck or collection. Do it for Johannes; he’d do the same for you! \r\n \r\n<br><br><strong>Contents:</strong>\r\n<br>• 1x Sanctum Prelate \r\n<br>•1x Carpet of Flowers \r\n<br>•1x Sphere of Safety \r\n<br>•1x Karmic Guide"
